  "features": [
    "adds a top-level Activity Workspace view",
    "creates user-controlled next actions with optional due dates and explicit status",
    "derives explainable attention signals from visible local project state",
    "surfaces active guided workflow progress and next incomplete steps",
    "builds a cross-project local activity timeline from existing project activity records",
    "supports project, time-window, stale-threshold, and signal-kind filters",
    "supports dismiss and restore for derived attention signals",
    "does not calculate productivity scores or send activity telemetry to a server",
    "retains canonical Knowledge Library route /knowledge-libraries/"
